      "L080-PDF-P3-MODULE-A": {
        "format": "pdf",
        "page": 3,
        "path": "Notes/music/guitar project/PDF version/Guitar_Exercises_Section_XI_Level_80_Chord_Melody_Independent_Voice_Control_Bass_Melody_Inner_Guide_Tones_and_Simultaneous_Accompaniment_Lead.pdf",
        "sha256": "cf99966ce9d5bd155d738dd30866a26fe0c30e2d633107393cf856bcb29c9afc",
        "text": "Guitar Exercises - Section XI, Level 80\nModule A - melody-on-top voicing control, studies 1-3\n3 STUDIES  |  48 EVENTS\nTOP VOICE MOVES; LOWER CHORD BODY REMAINS AS STABLE AS PRACTICAL\nCmaj7 - melody E-F-G-E\nMelody: E-F-G-E\nHigh-e/B route: x-5-5-3\nPattern: chord - melody - chord - melody\ntop line ascends then resolves\nPass 1: melody only. Pass 2: sustain bass + one guide tone. Pass 3: full voicing. Pass 4: remove one inner voice without changing\nmelody timing.\nDm7 - melody F-G-A-F\nMelody: F-G-A-F\nHigh-e/B route: 6-8-10-6\nPattern: chord - melody - chord - melody\nkeep D bass stable\nPass 1: melody only. Pass 2: sustain bass + one guide tone. Pass 3: full voicing. Pass 4: remove one inner voice without changing\nmelody timing.\nG7 - melody B-C-D-B\nMelody: B-C-D-B\nHigh-e/B route: 12-13-15-12\nPattern: chord - melody - chord - melody\nhear 3-11-5-3\nPass 1: melody only. Pass 2: sustain bass + one guide tone. Pass 3: full voicing. Pass 4: remove one inner voice without changing\nmelody timing.\nChord melody and independent-voice control: bass, inner guide tones, top-line melody, substitutions, and simultaneous accompaniment/lead.\nPage 3 of 20\n",
        "text_sha256": "374eb3920d17abaeb01af680779891522a06c5003e95a8f7766dd902b5b78f6a"
      },
