        "sha256": "e2297c8404a4041af1289e095fcace5012e5079698b0d7c32ff1bf77808de8b6",
        "text": "MODULE A - MELODY ON TOP\nCmaj7: melody E-F-G-E; route x-5-5-3; top line ascends then resolves.",
